# CloudNova FDE Take-Home (Track B)

## Source of truth

- Business rules: `data/BUSINESS_CONTEXT.md`
- Implementation contracts: `specs/cleaned_schema.md`, `specs/api_cli.md`, `specs/eval_spec.md`
- If code and specs disagree, **fix the spec first**, then update code.

## Do

- Keep the demo runnable with `python -m app` after `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- Prefer deterministic template SQL for stakeholder questions; LLM path is optional
- Never commit `.env`, API keys, or DuckDB binaries if large — `data/processed/` may be gitignored rebuildable artifact
- Add/adjust eval cases when changing revenue, MRR, dedup, or FX logic
- Record material AI overrides and judgment calls in `docs/ai-session-notes.md`

## Don't

- Invent alternate list prices, FX rates, or revenue definitions
- Use RAG/embeddings for this track
- Gold-plate UI, cloud deploy, or extra frameworks beyond pandas/duckdb/openai client
- Skip showing generated SQL in ask responses

## Change discipline

1. Update the relevant file under `/specs`
2. Implement in `app/`
3. Update `evals/cases.yaml` expectations if numbers change for legitimate reasons
4. Note why in `docs/ai-session-notes.md` if it was an AI vs human judgment call
